  "title": "ARGformer American-admixture paper settings and unresolved native agreement",
  "unresolved_details": [
    "Resolve the biological sample-unit convention:1600 haplotypes and3200haplotypes are different workloads. Existing frozen C3 TreeLoom guards admit1600 only.",
    "Confirm or explicitly name substitution-model/discrete-genome assumptions; the legacy simulator hardcodesJC69/discrete coordinates.",
    "Resolve inference preprocessing relevant to path topology and unary nodes; current project v3 is a documented reconstruction.",
    "Freeze external ancestry semantics and unique-path coordinate/support before truth. No ancestry-purity selection or hidden majority rule.",
    "Choose a named author-release variant or a separately reviewed paper-equation correction for temperature, masking corruption and class weighting. No variant is selected here.",
    "Freeze retrievalk and reference/query role views. Exact published Table1 checkpoint/weights/data are not supplied.",
    "Fresh seeds, runtime versions, threads and replicate counts may be documented new choices. They do not resolve material biological/evaluation conflicts.",
    "The existing legacy reconstruction and old products remain unchanged and must not be relabelled as this pending paper recipe.",
    "FLARE is included in the primary paired comparison. Its original Table1 version/options and native marker-to-query-path mapping are not supplied; freeze disclosed native settings without claiming recovered paper flags.",
    "A named config-only temperature.05 overlay is feasible without changing author algorithms. It remains an unselected candidate and does not settle masking prose or class-weight fallback.",
    "Potential model.train_loader interpolation is an explicit, unqualified config-wiring correction candidate; realized inverse-frequency weights still require future qualification."
  ]
}
